      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but I'm a bit worried about how the Board will react if they see the Engineering numbers. They're big on data, so if they spot that 37% jump, it's going to derail the whole conversation about our stability.\n\nCan we rephrase that part about Engineering? Instead of calling it a \"significant increase,\" can you frame it in a way that sounds more like a normal, predictable shift? Maybe something about seasonal movement or restructuring? I just need the summary to stay focused on the overall health of the company.",
